  "description": "VEGCOB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C6 H16 N1 1+,C112 H162 Gd5 N10 O30 1-,2(C4 H10 O1),H2 O1,C3 H7 N1 O1. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.624-4.783 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.44-137.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C129H207Gd5N12O34. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Gd(III).",
